---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Set up host integrations

Usage: sbt setup [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  ssh   Let `ssh NAME.sbx` reach a sandbox (adds a managed block to ~/.ssh/config)
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -h, --help
          Print help
